text Tears are dripping down her face and off her jaw. The bitten-off part of the bread she's holding soaks them up like a sponge.
text She must have been bracing herself the whole while.
text ...Probably worried all this time; and having the whole weekend to just think about things likely made matters worse.
text I curse myself for being so damn insensitive.
text I snatch the bread away from her hands and tear off the part wet with her tears.
text I toss it into my mouth.
sound H3K.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Ah─
text I'm not sure what she thinks after seeing that...
text It's just, I felt like drinking her tears, that's all.
text I guess it's because it's my fault she was crying them in the first place.
text @[Tomoya]
text Y'know, you might be an idiot, but... that's fine.
